💬 Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)
Q: Will YouTube ban or flag my account?

No. AdShield does not alter your YouTube account or inject malicious scripts. It plays the ad at high speed and simulates a normal click on the skip button—behaving just like an extremely fast human.

Q: Does AdShield collect my data or track my browsing?

Never. AdShield has no servers, no analytics, no cookies, and no tracking scripts. All counters (ads blocked, time saved) are stored exclusively on your own computer inside chrome.storage.local.

Q: Does it work on livestreams and YouTube Shorts?

Yes. Sponsored cards, Shorts promotional items, and display banners are cleaned across the entire site.

Q: How do I turn it off temporarily?

Simply click the AdShield icon in your browser toolbar and toggle the Master Protection switch to pause it anytime.

